OL,3,AZelensky says he expects war to
OL,4,Acontinue into winter after talks with
OL,5,AUS envoys
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fhas said he expects the war with Russia
OL,9,Fto continue into the winter, following
OL,10,Ftalks with Donald Trump's top envoys in
OL,11,FKyiv.
OL,13,FThe discussions finished without an
OL,14,Fannouncement of a major breakthrough,
OL,15,Fafter Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner
OL,16,Ftravelled to Ukraine for the first time
OL,17,Fsince Russia's full-scale invasion. The
OL,18,Fprevious day, the pair had held talks
OL,19,Fwith Vladimir Putin in Moscow.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
